1
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:02.154
Ntchito ya Arclight.

2
00:00:02.154 --> 00:00:05.633
Momwe mungachotsere matenda a maso popereka magalasi?

3
00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:10.850
Popereka magalasi a maso ndikofunika kuti musaphatikizepo matenda ena a maso.

4
00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:15.084
Ndi tchati chowoneka bwino komanso chida cha Arclight mutha kudziwa mwachangu yemwe akufunika

5
00:00:15.084 --> 00:00:19.318
magalasi ndi mtundu wanji ndi omwe angafunikire kutumiza ku matenda ena monga ng'ala ndi

6
00:00:19.318 --> 00:00:23.552
glaucoma.

7
00:00:23.552 --> 00:00:30.480
Yambani ndi kuyesa diso limodzi panthawi osathandizidwa ndipo ngati kuchepetsedwa gwiritsani ntchito pinbole.

8
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.520
ndiye yesani pafupi ndi masomphenya ndi maso onse pamodzi.

9
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:36.920
Nthawi zambiri pamakhala zotsatira zisanu.

10
00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:40.400
Ngati mtunda wa pafupi ndi maso ndi abwino,

11
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.780
wodwala safuna magalasi.

12
00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:45.160
Ngati kuona mtunda kwachepa,

13
00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.920
koma zimakhala bwino ndi pinhole ndipo masomphenya apafupi ali bwino,

14
00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:53.360
ndiye kuti wodwalayo amakhala ndi maso pang'ono, omwe amadziwikanso kuti myopic.

15
00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:57.920
Ngati masomphenya a mtunda wachepetsedwa koma akuyenda bwino ndi pinhole,

16
00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:00.920
ndipo masomphenya apafupi nawonso amachepetsedwa;

17
00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:03.920
ndiye kuti wodwalayo amakhala akuwona nthawi yayitali,

18
00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:06.920
amadziwikanso kuti hyperopia.

19
00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.920
Ngati masomphenya a mtunda ali bwino,

20
00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.920
koma masomphenya apafupi afupika;

21
00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.920
ndipo wodwala ali ndi zaka zopitilira 40,

22
00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:16.920
ndiye asindikiza biopia ndipo amafunikira magalasi owerengera.

23
00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:19.920
Pomaliza, ngati kusawona bwino kumachepetsedwa

24
00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:22.920
ndipo sichikuyenda bwino ndi pinhole kapena magalasi,

25
00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.920
ndiye kuti matenda a m'maso ndizotheka kwambiri,

26
00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:28.778
wodwala amafunika kuyesedwa ndi nyali ya arc.

27
00:01:28.778 --> 00:01:33.270
Pitani kuchipinda chomwe chili ndi kuwala kocheperako ndikuyamba ndi chindunji

28
00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:34.455
Mwana wa diso kuwala reflex.

29
00:01:34.455 --> 00:01:38.010
Anthu onse awiri ayenera kuwongolera mofanana komanso mwachangu kuti awala.

30
00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.590
Ngati satero

31
00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:43.386
constrict bwino, pakhoza kukhala matenda a optic mitsempha kapena retina

32
00:01:43.386 --> 00:01:44.470
kumbuyo kwa

33
00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:49.230
diso, monga glaucoma kapena retinal detachment.

34
00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:51.422
Kenako fufuzani mayeso a fundal reflex.

35
00:01:51.422 --> 00:01:54.710
Kuwala kofananira reflex kumatanthauza kuti palibe chotchinga

36
00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.730
kuwala kolowa m’diso.

37
00:01:56.730 --> 00:02:00.770
Ngati reflex yafupika kapena kulibe, ndiye cataract, cornea

38
00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:05.759
chilonda, magazi kumbuyo kwa diso kapena chotupa, mwina kutsekereza kuwala.

39
00:02:05.759 --> 00:02:07.090
Kenako fufuzani kutsogolo

40
00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:10.396
diso, kutseka ndi gawo lakunja lozungulira.

41
00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:12.710
Yang'anani matenda aliwonse a cornea ndi zipsera

42
00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:13.578
kapena ng'ala.

43
00:02:13.578 --> 00:02:18.782
Pomaliza, chitani optomoscopy mwachindunji ndikuyang'ana kumbuyo kwa diso.

44
00:02:18.782 --> 00:02:19.650
Xammon optic

45
00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:24.850
mitsempha ndi retina zizindikiro za glaucoma, chithokomiro retinopathy, zipsera ndi retina

46
00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:25.203
gulu.

47
00:02:25.203 --> 00:02:29.790
Ngati matenda alipo kapena simungathe kudziwa chifukwa chake

48
00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:34.050
masomphenya a wodwala ali oyera, ndiye pangani ndondomeko kuti wodwalayo awone ndi katswiri wa maso.

49
00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:38.090
Kanemayu akuwonetsa kuti kudzera muzoyeserera ndi upangiri wanthawi zonse,

50
00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:42.530
Ogwira ntchito zachipatala wamba, ngakhale ali ndi zida zotsika mtengo, amatha kumvetsetsa ngati a

51
00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:46.610
wodwala angapindule ndi magalasi amaso kapena angafunike kutumizidwa kuti akalandire chithandizo chamankhwala

52
00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:47.104
matenda.

53
00:02:47.104 --> 00:02:53.530
Njira yamphamvu yokhala ndi chida chimodzi chotsika mtengo kulikonse padziko lapansi ndi

54
00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:55.930
aliyense.
